{"chapter_id":"main-quest-21037","main_id":21037,"main_title":"剑去之日","main_description":"距离孙宇离开璃月港的日子，似乎越来越近了…","chapter_title":"剑去之日","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":2103704,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2103704,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":210370401,"next_line_ids":[210370402],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2418,"speaker_text_hash":1921778277,"speaker":"小雀儿","speaker_raw":"小雀儿","text_hash":1562566170,"text":"芷若姐姐，你…你说师兄他是不是故意的！他就是…就是不想和我呆在一块！呜…","raw_text":"芷若姐姐，你…你说师兄他是不是故意的！他就是…就是不想和我呆在一块！呜…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2103704.json"}
